<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov compound feed output falls 1.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov compound feed output falls 1.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's compound feed production in November 1996 totalled 2.13 million tonnes, down 1.6 percent from a year earlier, the Agriculture Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Details of November output, sales and stocks were as follows (in millions of tonnes):</p>
<p>		  Nov 96     Oct 95     yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Production   2.13	 2.18	 -1.6</p>
<p> Sales	  2.14	 2.16	 -0.8</p>
<p> Stocks	 0.19	 0.18	 +0.8</p>
<p>Major grains used in base mixes for November compound feed output (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Nov 96	     Oct 96	     Nov 95</p>
<p> Corn	    998,475	   1,019,990	  1,035,479</p>
<p> Sorghum	 230,095	     234,413	    199,510</p>
<p>Major meals used in base mixes (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Nov 96	     Oct 96	     Nov 95</p>
<p> Soybean meal  259,878	     268,167	    257,330</p>
<p> Rapeseed meal  73,606		74,524	     77,158</p>
<p> Fish meal	25,596		26,672	     28,299</p>
</text>
